 from the core offerings of basic  standard enhanced and premium and there  are also additional value added services  available for enhanced and premium and  will be going through each offering in  detail starting with basic this is the  support tier you will receive when you  sign up on google cloud you can unveil  this offering at no cost via chat phone  or cases but only for billing related  issues additionally please check the  link in the description box below to get  the price and details for the other  offerings next we have standard support  a simple and flexible way to ensure that  your workloads are running smoothly on  google cloud standard support is a paid  support offering highly recommended for  small and medium enterprises looking to  begin their journey on google cloud this  offering helps you to easily build  troubleshoot and test standard enables  you to receive technical help from  google experts through creating cases  with a four hour response time for cases  with high impact and a overall eight  five availability next up we have  enhanced support which delivers rapid  response times and additional services  to boost your productivity and help you  run the cloud efficiently there is both  case and phone support for technical  issues with a one hour response time  there is 24x5 availability overall and  24x7 for critical issues you can also  have add-ons or value-add services like  we mentioned earlier like technical  account advisor service and event  management and the final offering is  premium support premium support is the  highest value support offering supplying  you with incredibly fast response times  there are many features that come with  having premium support some of which  include having a named technical account  manager having new product previews  operational health reviews training  resources as well as an event management  service  there is also case and phone support for  technical issues as well as third party  technology support there is also a  15-minute response time for critical  impact cases as well as 24 7 support for  critical impact issues moving on to a  demonstration let's go over how to  purchase support within your google  cloud console go to your google cloud  console and you can see your dashboard  now move to the navigation menu  hover over support and click on overview  here's the overview dashboard for your  support page  go to the support information card and  select view support offerings  under standard support for example click  on buy now in the drop down list select  the google cloud organization resource  for the offering and then click on  continue in the drop down list here  select the cloud billing account for the  standard support base fee read and agree  to the terms of service  and then click on complete purchase and  that's it you have yourself your  standard support tier it works very  similarly for enhanced as well as  premium support  next moving on to the second demo i'll  be showing you how you can create a  support case in your console first go to  your console and navigate to the support  page as a support user as you can see in  the console you can create cases through  various channels depending on your  support package in the cases tab if you  have previously created any cases you  should be able to see a list of them  over here and from here to create a new  case simply click on create case and  following that all you need to do is to  complete the required fields first you  need to give your case a title  and following that give it a priority  ranging from p1 to p4 with p1 being the  most critical  thirdly all you need to do is to select  a category  as well as a component and last but not  least all you have to do is to fill out  the description as you can see after  selecting the category as well as the  component a description template has  been created for you and you simply need  to add in that information at the same  time on the right hand side of the  screen you can see the help assistant  dynamically providing some useful  articles which are relevant to your case  and could be helpful to explore and  finally in the last step you can click  submit to submit the case in this demo  i'm not gonna do so but you can when  creating a new support case  after you submit the case you will be  redirected to the case page where you  can easily make any form of edits to the  attributes add on any further comments  as well as upload attachments to the  case and that concludes our overview on  support packages do check out the links  in the description box below to find out  more about customer care and support at  google cloud we're so happy to be  successfully concluding our first  segment of the startup journey which was  the start series let's do a recap of our  journey we kicked off the series with  the launch video where we did an  overview of the series we then learned  how to get started on google cloud with  an introduction to the resource  hierarchy cloud ins and lots of  demonstrations then you learned how you  can deploy your applications with cloud  run for application development you also  saw how to configure google kubernetes  engine how you could build and leverage  google compute engine as well as manage  your networking configurations  we then did the database configurations  for the same application so you know how  the flow for a single application works  we learned how firebase can be used to  build improve and grow your application  and learned how to manage your ci cd  deployments on google cloud we also went  over logging monitoring and more with  cloud operations for your deployed  applications and following that we also  went through billing as well as cost  optimization and finally for today's  episode which is the final episode of  the start series we also went through  customer care support as well as the  support packages available to provide  you with the integrated care experience  and with that that concludes our start  series we're so thankful that you joined  us on this journey we're really excited  to share with you more in our next  segment the build series where we are  going to help startups that have already  launched on google cloud to optimize and  scale let us know in the comment section  below what you thought of the series  don't forget to like and subscribe to  our youtube channel and stay tuned for  more such amazing content  and that's a wrap thank you and we can't  wait to see you in our next series bye  for now  [Music]
 

